   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">שלום יונתן</span><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">אולי אפשר להשתמש ב </span><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">log=’’<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\">אני לא בטוחה אבל אולי?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">plot(x, y = NULL, type = &quot;p&quot;,  xlim = NULL, ylim = NULL,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">     <span style=\"background:yellow\">log = &quot;&quot;</span>, main = NULL, sub = NULL, xlab = NULL, ylab = NULL,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">     ann = par(&quot;ann&quot;), axes = TRUE, frame.plot = axes,<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\">     panel.first = NULL, panel.last = NULL, asp = NA, ...)<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" summary=\"R argblock\"><tr><td width=\"54\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:40.3pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">log</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"><u></u><u></u></span></p></td><td width=\"928\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:696.2pt;padding:.75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">a character string which contains </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">&quot;x&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> if the x axis is to be logarithmic, </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">&quot;y&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> if the y axis is to be logarithmic <br>and </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">&quot;xy&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> or </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">&quot;yx&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> if both axes are to be logarithmic.<u></u><u></u></span></p></td></tr></table></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div lang=\"EN-US\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span dir=\"LTR\" style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-...@googlegroups.com</a>] <b>On Behalf Of </b>Jonathan Schwartz<br><b>Sent:</b> 14 September 2014 10:26<br><b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">israel-r-...@googlegroups.com</a><br><b>Subject:</b> [Israel RUG] <span lang=\"HE\" dir=\"RTL\">שינוי הערכים בציר בגרף</span><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span dir=\"LTR\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\">שלום</span><span dir=\"LTR\"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\">מישהו יודע איך לשנות את הערכים של המערכת צירים בגרף?<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\">כשזה בערכים גדולים הוא עושה  אקסופננט ..<u></u><u></u></span></p><p dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\">או לחילופין איך זה נקרא באנגלית שאני אחפש בעצמי בגוגל<u></u><u></u></span></p><p dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p><p dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\"><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-7SARXaZMswg/VBVC9vNE8hI/AAAAAAAAAV0/U1OF5Th8Qn0/s1600/%D7%92%D7%A8%D7%A3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-7SARXaZMswg/VBVC9vNE8hI/AAAAAAAAAV0/U1OF5Th8Qn0/s1600/%25D7%2592%25D7%25A8%25D7%25A3.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792497785405000&amp;usg=AOvVaw16zpQo-RsrCk048Uw0e60E\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" dir=\"LTR\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"161\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-7SARXaZMswg/VBVC9vNE8hI/AAAAAAAAAV0/U1OF5Th8Qn0/s320/%D7%92%D7%A8%D7%A3.jpg\"></span></a><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" dir=\"RTL\" style=\"text-align:right;direction:rtl;unicode-bidi:embed\"><span lang=\"HE\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p></div></div></div>"
